  "cross_depth_reading_caveat": "ABSOLUTE lens statistics are NOT comparable between the two cells. A block-19 residual state is five blocks closer to the readout than a block-14 one, so its projection through W_U.RMSNorm(h) is systematically sharper — lower entropy, better-ranked gold tokens — for reasons that have nothing to do with the adapter. That is why each cell carries its OWN pooled and un-pooled natural reference rows, and why the verdict compares each site's payload to its own depth's reference rather than comparing the two sites' numbers to each other.",
  "depooled_payloads_should_be_read_against_the_single_row_reference": "cosine-to-natural is measured against the POOLED natural state at each block, for continuity with every prior pre-check receipt. Both of M5X's delivered payloads are DE-POOLED, so the like-for-like comparator is each cell's reference-receiver-*-single-row row, which is carried here for exactly that purpose.",
